# A game whose one system never ends: its fuel stops it every tick, within
# the 8 ms containment. The bench runs it.
program runaway.kest

component 0d3f8a3e-7c55-4b8e-9d0e-2a61f3c4b5a1 runaway.position Position

system runaway.spin simulation spin write runaway.position

spawn 1 runaway.position x=0
